# Kindred Visual Language Constitution (v1)

**Permanent editorial law.** Icons are not decoration — they help readers instantly
recognize what something is before reading a single word. Over time, Kindred readers
should recognize categories from the icon alone.

## One category = one icon

Every editorial category has **one permanent emoji**. Never rotate. Never substitute.
Never choose randomly.

- Every coffee shop → ☕
- Every theater → 🎭
- Every museum → 🏛️

